            </view>
          </view>

          <view class="buying-guide-note">
            <text class="buying-guide-note-title">购买说明</text>
            <text>Pour Notes 仅提供购买渠道信息参考。具体豆款、价格、库存、配送及售后服务均以店铺实际信息为准。</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>
  <view wx:if="{{showDataManager}}" class="data-manager-mask" bindtap="closeDataManager">
    <view class="data-manager-sheet" catchtap="preventBubble">
      <view class="data-manager-header">
        <view wx:if="{{dataManagerView !== 'main'}}" class="data-manager-back" bindtap="goBackDataManager">‹</view>
        <text class="data-manager-title">{{dataManagerView === 'export' ? '选择导出内容' : dataManagerView === 'importScope' ? '选择导入内容' : dataManagerView === 'importMode' ? '选择导入方式' : '数据管理'}}</text>
      </view>

      <view wx:if="{{dataManagerView === 'main'}}" class="data-manager-actions">
        <button class="data-manager-action" bindtap="showDataExportOptions" disabled="{{dataExportBusy || dataImportBusy}}">
          <image class="data-manager-action-icon" src="../../assets/icons/data-export.png" mode="aspectFit"></image>
          <text class="data-manager-action-title">导出数据</text>
          <text class="data-manager-action-copy">选择内容后发送备份文件</text>
        </button>
        <button class="data-manager-action" bindtap="showDataImportOptions" disabled="{{dataExportBusy || dataImportBusy}}">
          <image class="data-manager-action-icon" src="../../assets/icons/data-import.png" mode="aspectFit"></image>
          <text class="data-manager-action-title">导入数据</text>
          <text class="data-manager-action-copy">选择覆盖或追加到现有数据</text>
        </button>
      </view>

      <view wx:elif="{{dataManagerView === 'export'}}" class="data-manager-option-grid">
        <button class="data-manager-option" data-scope="recipes" bindtap="exportLocalData" loading="{{dataExportBusy}}" disabled="{{dataExportBusy || dataImportBusy}}" hover-class="data-manager-option-hover">
          <text class="data-manager-option-title">自建方案</text>
          <text class="data-manager-option-copy">导出 {{recipes.length}} 个自建方案</text>
        </button>
        <button class="data-manager-option" data-scope="beans" bindtap="exportLocalData" loading="{{dataExportBusy}}" disabled="{{dataExportBusy || dataImportBusy}}" hover-class="data-manager-option-hover">
          <text class="data-manager-option-title">豆仓</text>
          <text class="data-manager-option-copy">导出 {{beans.length}} 包豆子</text>
        </button>
        <button class="data-manager-option" data-scope="logs" bindtap="exportLocalData" loading="{{dataExportBusy}}" disabled="{{dataExportBusy || dataImportBusy}}" hover-class="data-manager-option-hover">
          <text class="data-manager-option-title">冲煮记录</text>
          <text class="data-manager-option-copy">导出 {{logs.length}} 条记录</text>
        </button>
        <button class="data-manager-option data-manager-option-all" data-scope="all" bindtap="exportLocalData" loading="{{dataExportBusy}}" disabled="{{dataExportBusy || dataImportBusy}}" hover-class="data-manager-option-hover">
          <text class="data-manager-option-title">全部数据</text>
          <text class="data-manager-option-copy">豆仓、方案和冲煮记录</text>
        </button>
      </view>

      <view wx:elif="{{dataManagerView === 'importScope'}}" class="data-manager-option-grid">
        <button class="data-manager-option" data-scope="recipes" bindtap="selectDataImportScope" disabled="{{dataExportBusy || dataImportBusy}}" hover-class="data-manager-option-hover">
          <text class="data-manager-option-title">自建方案</text>
          <text class="data-manager-option-copy">仅导入方案数据</text>
        </button>
        <button class="data-manager-option" data-scope="beans" bindtap="selectDataImportScope" disabled="{{dataExportBusy || dataImportBusy}}" hover-class="data-manager-option-hover">
          <text class="data-manager-option-title">豆仓</text>
          <text class="data-manager-option-copy">仅导入咖啡豆数据</text>
        </button>
        <button class="data-manager-option" data-scope="logs" bindtap="selectDataImportScope" disabled="{{dataExportBusy || dataImportBusy}}" hover-class="data-manager-option-hover">
          <text class="data-manager-option-title">冲煮记录</text>
          <text class="data-manager-option-copy">仅导入冲煮记录</text>
        </button>
        <button class="data-manager-option data-manager-option-all" data-scope="all" bindtap="selectDataImportScope" disabled="{{dataExportBusy || dataImportBusy}}" hover-class="data-manager-option-hover">
          <text class="data-manager-option-title">全部数据</text>
          <text class="data-manager-option-copy">导入备份中的全部内容</text>
        </button>
      </view>

      <view wx:elif="{{dataManagerView === 'importMode'}}" class="data-manager-import-options">
        <button class="data-manager-option data-manager-import-option" data-mode="replace" bindtap="importLocalData" loading="{{dataImportBusy}}" disabled="{{dataExportBusy || dataImportBusy}}" hover-class="data-manager-option-hover">
          <text class="data-manager-option-title">覆盖原数据</text>
          <text class="data-manager-option-copy">备份中包含的类别将替换本机对应数据</text>
        </button>
        <button class="data-manager-option data-manager-import-option" data-mode="append" bindtap="importLocalData" loading="{{dataImportBusy}}" disabled="{{dataExportBusy || dataImportBusy}}" hover-class="data-manager-option-hover">
          <text class="data-manager-option-title">保留并追加</text>
          <text class="data-manager-option-copy">保留本机数据，将备份内容作为新记录加入</text>
        </button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{showPrivacyAgreement}}" class="privacy-mask">
    <view class="privacy-panel privacy-document-panel">
      <view class="privacy-document-header">
        <text class="privacy-title">隐私协议</text>
        <view class="privacy-document-close" bindtap="closePrivacyContract">×</view>
      </view>
      <scroll-view scroll-y class="privacy-document-scroll">
        <text class="privacy-document-updated">更新日期：2026年7月15日</text>
        <view class="privacy-document-section">
          <text class="privacy-document-heading">一、我们处理的信息</text>
          <text>Pour Notes 用于记录咖啡豆、冲煮方案和冲煮记录。你可以自行输入昵称，并主动选择头像。我们不获取你的微信昵称或手机号。</text>
        </view>
        <view class="privacy-document-section">
          <text class="privacy-document-heading">二、数据存储</text>
          <text>你的头像、昵称、咖啡豆、方案和冲煮记录保存在当前设备。寻豆指南的公开豆单与图片由腾讯云 CloudBase 提供，并会缓存在当前设备以提升加载速度。使用拍照识别豆袋时，你主动选择的照片会临时上传至腾讯云 CloudBase，由 PaddleOCR 提取文字；识别请求结束后，小程序会自动删除该临时照片。</text>
        </view>
        <view class="privacy-document-section">
          <text class="privacy-document-heading">三、数据管理</text>
          <text>你可以在“我的”页面通过“数据管理”按类别或全部导出 JSON 备份，也可以从微信聊天记录选择备份文件，并选择覆盖对应类别或保留本机数据后追加。“清除本机数据”会删除个人数据，操作前请先自行导出备份；“清除云端内容缓存”只会删除公开豆单与图片缓存。</text>
        </view>
        <view class="privacy-document-section">
          <text class="privacy-document-heading">四、信息共享</text>
          <text>我们不会出售或出租你的个人信息及冲煮数据。拍照识别产生的照片和识别结果仅用于本次豆袋信息填写，不用于模型训练。只有在你主动选择“导出数据”时，备份文件才会通过微信的文件分享能力发送到你选择的聊天。</text>
        </view>
        <view class="privacy-document-section">
          <text class="privacy-document-heading">五、协议更新</text>
          <text>如功能或数据处理方式发生变化，我们会同步更新本协议，并在小程序内展示最新内容。</text>
        </view>
      </scroll-view>
      <button class="privacy-primary-button privacy-document-confirm" bindtap="closePrivacyContract">我知道了</button>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{activeTab === 'brew' && !brewHomeVisible && brewStep === 0 && showCustomDripperForm}}" class="custom-dripper-overlay">
    <view class="custom-dripper-panel">
      <input adjust-position="{{true}}" cursor-spacing="24" placeholder="输入滤杯名称" value="{{customDripperName}}" bindinput="onCustomDripperInput" />
      <view class="custom-dripper-actions">
        <button class="primary-button" bindtap="saveCustomDripper">保存</button>
        <button class="secondary-button" bindtap="cancelCustomDripperForm">取消</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
</view>
